 "decisions": [
  "Size passives and unlock layers for sand-wall-primer (7.8 W of 8, hold-the-line L1), sand-holding-sabre-canon (bonus defense_pct 10, 14.8 W of 16, answering-cut L1, hold-the-sand L2), and sword-washing-temper (bonus attack_pct 10, 14.7 W of 16, spring-quench L1) against same-tier Earth/Metal methods so every holder accesses their arts.",
  "Author hold-the-line as a c_art 0.0 ward art (8% body shield + 1 Earth buff + dampen_taken 12 while Composed) with no stance so guards stay Composed and avoid stance conflicts with loose-north's ho_dien_liet.",
  "Give hold-the-sand a combined hold-the-sand-iron stance with iron-hide-stance for vien_co_yen and ninh_ha_vien, re-merging iron-hide on pulse and duplicating iron-hide-temper on was_hit, and express 'charges stopped' via foe.pressing / own.foe_pressed timer next +0.4 s delay.",
  "Implement answering-cut using blocked (event.amount > 0) -> answering_guard -> empower (c_mult 1.5, off_guard 2 s).",
  "Use unique art id spring-quench (quench exists in part-a.json) and carry sword-washing-temper's hit-taken Earth skin / hit-landed Metal weapon temper triggers on spring-quench, consuming all Metal buffs (+15% dmg_more each) with pen 150, pierce 35, and bypass 0.25.",
  "Approximate Smoke on the Road with acc +100 from was_hit (own.field_up >= 1, event.amount > 0) until Answering Cut lands because neither engine filters acc by art_id; scope The Rider Comes In +25% dmg_more to answering-cut when foe has Earth debuff or Slowed Time.",
  "Mark all 3 signature items unique: true, sources: [npc], with the R6 exception on ts-lone-smoke-sabre, ts-quench-hammer, and ts-caravan-shield."
 ],
